      "standardized_narrative": "At 1 January 2022 gross claims outstanding were $566.8m. During 2022 management recorded an increase in prior year provisions of $88.7m gross (approximately 15.6% of opening gross claims outstanding) indicating an adverse prior-year development (strengthening). The annual report also notes favourable attritional improvements in 2020 and prior-year reserves from the perspective of the 2020 year-of-account result (this refers to net/reinsured impacts). The 2022 underwriting year was driven by several major catastrophe events (Hurricane Ian, eastern Australian floods, derecho events) and the Russia/Ukraine conflict which affected underwriting performance and reserve positioning.",
